graph LR
  subgraph Experience[体验层]
    WEB[Next.js Web 客服工作台]
    ADMIN[Admin 控制台 deletions / evaluations / operations]
    SDK[TypeScript SDK]
  end

  subgraph Control[TypeScript 控制层]
    API[NestJS API / BFF]
    AUTH[OIDC Guard + 统一授权决策]
    SCOPE[ACL 作用域编译 acl_scope_key]
    ORCH[Retrieval Orchestrator 混合检索 + 融合 + Rerank]
    RECHECK[候选权威复核 批量 PG 校验]
    RESOLVE[全序冲突消解 + 注入运行期检查]
    ANSWER[AnswerModule 风险分级生成]
    CIT[CitationModule 句级引用验证]
    FINAL[AnswerFinalizer 唯一终态提交]
    DOC[Document Service 两段式上传 + 审核]
    QP[Quick Parse 会话临时候选/索引 不进入生产 Alias]
    DEL[Deletion Orchestrator + Legal Hold 校验]
  end

  subgraph Async[异步数据面 worker:ingestion]
    OUTBOX[Outbox Relay Publisher Confirm]
    Q[RabbitMQ Exchange / Retry TTL+DLX / DLQ]
    ING[Ingestion Worker]
    PARSE[Python DeepDOC Parser Service 异步 parserTaskId]
    SCAN[注入静态扫描 + 质量门禁]
    CHUNK[分块 + Embedding 冻结 ChunkingManifest]
    INDEX[Index Projection Worker]
    SEARCH[Document + Chunk Sparse Projection]
    VECTOR[Chunk Vector Projection]
    GRAPH[Future Graph Projection]
    RELEASE[Candidate Release Builder ReleaseManifest]
    VALIDATE[Release Validator smoke check]
    ALIAS[Alias Switcher + Reconciler ReleaseActivation]
  end

  subgraph Ops2[治理与运维 Worker]
    EVAL[worker:evaluation 黄金集 + 发布门禁]
    CLEAN[Cleanup Worker 临时对象 TTL + 孤儿清扫]
    REPLAY[人工重放 新 executionGeneration]
  end

  subgraph Data[数据层]
    PG[(PostgreSQL 事实源 / Outbox / 审计)]
    LEDGER[(model_budget_ledger 预扣 / 结算 / lease)]
    OS[(OpenSearch 版本化索引 + Alias)]
    OBJ[(MinIO 本地 / OSS 未来适配)]
    REDIS[(Redis 作用域缓存 / 限流 / SSE 续读窗)]
    NEO4J[(Neo4j P1 Optional)]
  end

  subgraph Identity[身份]
    KC[Keycloak OIDC]
  end

  subgraph Models[模型服务]
    MODEL[Internal ModelAdapter 数据等级准入 + 预算门禁]
    CLOUD[阿里云百炼 Chat / Embedding / Reranker]
  end

  subgraph Ops[观测层]
    OTEL[OpenTelemetry traceparent 内建]
    OBS[Prometheus + Grafana + Loki/Tempo 按需 Profile]
  end

  WEB --> API
  ADMIN --> API
  SDK --> API
  API --> AUTH
  AUTH -. Token 校验 / 撤权 fail closed .-> KC
  AUTH --> SCOPE
  SCOPE -->|编译允许作用域集合| PG
  SCOPE -. aclRevision 失效缓存 .-> REDIS
  AUTH --> ORCH
  AUTH --> DOC
  AUTH --> QP
  AUTH --> DEL

  ORCH -->|BM25 + kNN 按 acl_scope_key 过滤| OS
  ORCH -->|查询 Embedding + Rerank| MODEL
  ORCH --> RECHECK
  RECHECK -->|文档级 ACL 例外 / 墓碑 / Legal Hold / 有效期| PG
  RECHECK --> RESOLVE
  RESOLVE -->|RetrievalSnapshot 冻结| PG
  RESOLVE --> ANSWER
  ANSWER -->|Chat 生成 高风险先缓冲| MODEL
  ANSWER --> CIT
  CIT -->|句级 Embedding + 高风险蕴含| MODEL
  CIT --> FINAL
  FINAL -->|回答快照 唯一长期正文副本| OBJ
  FINAL -->|SSE 事件 runId+seq TTL 24h| REDIS
  FINAL -->|元数据 + 载荷哈希 + 审计| PG
  MODEL --> CLOUD
  MODEL -->|调用前预扣 / 结算 / lease 回收| LEDGER
  LEDGER --- PG
  API -. 用户级限流 429 + Retry-After .-> REDIS

  DOC -->|presign tmp 后服务端 promote| OBJ
  DOC -->|object_claim + document_version + outbox_event 同事务| PG
  QP -. 复用文件安全 / Parser / 注入检查 .-> PARSE
  QP -. TTL 到期降级 .-> REDIS
  PG --> OUTBOX
  OUTBOX --> Q
  Q --> ING
  Q --> EVAL
  ING --> PARSE
  PARSE -->|ParseArtifact 原子提交| OBJ
  ING --> SCAN
  SCAN --> CHUNK
  CHUNK --> INDEX
  INDEX --> SEARCH
  INDEX --> VECTOR
  SEARCH --> RELEASE
  VECTOR --> RELEASE
  INDEX -. optional .-> GRAPH
  GRAPH -. future projection .-> NEO4J
  RELEASE --> VALIDATE
  VALIDATE --> ALIAS
  ALIAS -->|原子切换 Candidate 至 Active| OS
  ALIAS -->|激活事实 + 对账 + 回滚| PG
  INDEX --> PG
  CHUNK -->|Embedding 调用| MODEL

  Q -. DLQ .-> REPLAY
  REPLAY -->|关闭 dead_letter 新 Generation| PG
  CLEAN --> OBJ
  CLEAN -->|删除证明| PG
  EVAL --> OS
  EVAL --> MODEL
  EVAL -->|门禁报告| PG

  DEL -->|deletion_request / deletion_target| PG
  DEL --> OS
  DEL --> OBJ
  DEL --> REDIS
  DEL --> Q

  API -. Trace .-> OTEL
  ORCH -. Trace .-> OTEL
  FINAL -. Trace .-> OTEL
  ING -. Trace .-> OTEL
  OTEL --> OBS

